# TEST FIXTURE (id 224): the two rooms of the C9 mini league (contract section 50.2), stacked in one map. Not part of the game: reached only through the lobby (test_c9sys, 223) by the host harness.
#   room A (j 11..18): the first member `m1` (a trainer, beaten flag league_e1) at (5,13). The door BEHIND the hero is the NPC `x` (5,19): it appears when league_run is set (the on_enter script sets it as the hero arrives)
#   and is solid; there is no warp back at all (the real rooms are one map each, with no exit warp). The door AHEAD is the NPC `A` (4,11) in front of the warp cell `a` (4,10): shut (solid, `gate=yes` for mapc's
#   reachability) until the beaten flag of the member (league_e1) is set (hide_flag).
#   room B (j 1..9): the champion at (5,2) (a hand-written script: the fight, league_champ, `ending run`, `ending title`); the door behind B is the NPC `b` (7,9), the same as `x`.
# NPC doors are the idiom: a solid NPC with show_flag / hide_flag on the tile IN FRONT of a warp cell (mapc refuses an NPC on a warp cell).
@map test_c9sys_b
@size 11 21
@interior no
@bg 0
@fill dirt_a
@spawn enter1 5 18 NE
@spawn roomb 4 9 NE
@legend
  .  tile=dirt_a
  W  tile=dirt_a solid=yes
  a  tile=dirt_a
  M  tile=dirt_a npc=vecino id=m1 face=SW trainer=rival_lab text=c9sys.m1.pre after=c9sys.m1.after beaten_flag=league_e1 range=4
  C  tile=dirt_a npc=rival id=champ face=SW script=champ
  A  tile=dirt_a npc=keydoor id=door_a face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.locked hide_flag=league_e1
  x  tile=dirt_a npc=keydoor id=door_x face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.shut show_flag=league_run
  b  tile=dirt_a npc=keydoor id=door_b face=S solid=yes gate=yes text=gl.c9.door.shut show_flag=league_run
@warp a -> test_c9sys_b spawn=roomb
@grid
  WWWWWWWWWWW
  W.........W
  W....C....W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W......b..W
  WWWWaWWWWWW
  W...A.....W
  W.........W
  W....M....W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W.........W
  W....x....W
  WWWWWWWWWWW
# Entering room A shuts the door behind the hero and starts the run (flag league_run; a blackout clears it). Idempotent: a Continuar inside does not shut it twice.
@script league_in on_enter
    jf league_run in
    sfx door
    setf league_run
    say gl.c9.door.shut
  in:
@end
# The champion: the fight, then the ending: the Hall of Legacy -> the record -> the save at home -> the credits (all inside `ending run`), then back to the title. A defeat is a blackout.
@script champ npc
    jf league_champ again
    say c9sys.champ.pre
    battle 1 0
    jv 0 1 won
    blackout
    end
  won:
    setf league_champ
    say c9sys.champ.win
    ending run 1
    jv 1 0 fail
    ending title
    end
  fail:
    say gl.c9.end.fail
    end
  again:
    say c9sys.champ.after
@end
